**[00:00:10] Person D:** Thanks for joining. Last session we captured your current state in detail — the on-prem warehouse, the four data marts, the GUI ETL tool. Today we want to start narrowing down target state, specifically the platform and cloud direction, so Person E's team can start scoping the landing zone. Person A, where's your head at on cloud provider?

