**[00:01:15] Person C:** Right, and from an infrastructure side, we already have an Enterprise Agreement with Microsoft that covers a good chunk of this. If we went AWS or GCP we'd be negotiating a net-new commercial relationship and losing volume discounts we already have. That's a real cost consideration, not just a preference.

